      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HE'S A TYCOON (5) did a good job to finish third last time out over 400m at this track (23.28) in a TG1-4W, the second top-three finish on the trot. This looks easier and expected to bounce back. FLASH MARSHALL (7) has been a little hard to follow, finishing out of the placings latest but was in winning form two back scoring in a Maiden at this track. Well placed here and can atone this time. SAINT FRANKLIN (1) slotted in just off the lead from the wide draw last start and boxed on to finish third (17.90) at this track in a TG1-4W over 305m. Expected to feature again. CAN DO GRACE (2) will run well despite no experience on this track.",
